<text top="98" left="324" width="54" height="10" font="5">UMMARY</text>
<text top="96" left="382" width="10" height="12" font="4">D</text>
<text top="98" left="393" width="76" height="10" font="5">IALOGUE ON</text>
<text top="96" left="473" width="10" height="12" font="4">D</text>
<text top="98" left="485" width="76" height="10" font="5">ISTRIBUTION</text>
<text top="139" left="129" width="61" height="10" font="2"><b>Professor:</b></text>
<text top="139" left="194" width="114" height="14" font="3"><i>No, please, after you.</i></text>
<text top="159" left="129" width="52" height="10" font="2"><b>Student:</b></text>
<text top="159" left="185" width="103" height="14" font="3"><i>(exasperated) Fine!</i></text>
<text top="179" left="129" width="61" height="10" font="2"><b>Professor:</b></text>
<text top="179" left="194" width="200" height="14" font="3"><i>(waiting) ... so why haven’t you left?</i></text>
<text top="200" left="129" width="52" height="10" font="2"><b>Student:</b></text>
<text top="200" left="185" width="375" height="14" font="3"><i>I don’t know how. Turns out, the only thing I can do is participate in</i></text>
<text top="215" left="129" width="84" height="14" font="3"><i>these dialogues.</i></text>
<text top="235" left="129" width="61" height="10" font="2"><b>Professor:</b></text>
<text top="235" left="194" width="274" height="14" font="3"><i>Me too. And now you’ve learned our final lesson...</i></text>
